<title>UK: World Bank sets 750 mln Slovak crown bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 750 mln Slovak crown bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    750 MLN SK    COUPON     13.25     MATURITY    04.FEB.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.80    PAY DATE    04.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0	 REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 25-200-1M SALE LIMITS US/UK/SL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 GOV LAW     UK</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  0.80	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
